<title>UK: IBCA rates NatWest 2011 notes AA.</title>
<headline>IBCA rates NatWest 2011 notes AA.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>IBCA, the European credit rating agency said on Tuesday it assigned an AA rating to National Westminster Bank Plc's 300 million stg step-up subordinated 2011 notes.</p>
<p>&quot;NatWest is the largest UK bank in terms of total assets and is also one of the 20 largest banks in the world,&quot; IBCA said in a statement.</p>
<p>&quot;Its considerable retail and corporate deposit base in the UK provides it with strong liquidity and NatWest comfortably meets EU capital adequacy requirements,&quot; it said.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 6176</p>
